# Prompt

Redesign my entire `api-tester.ejs` page into a modern SaaS-style API Management Dashboard while preserving ALL existing functionality, IDs, JavaScript functions, API calls, endpoints, form fields, and business logic.

## Requirements

### Tech Stack

* Bootstrap 5.3
* Bootstrap Icons
* Google Font: Inter
* Pure CSS (no Tailwind)
* Responsive Design
* EJS compatible

---

## Design Style

Create a premium modern dashboard inspired by:

* Postman
* Insomnia
* Stripe Dashboard
* Vercel Dashboard
* Linear

Use:

* Dark Theme
* Glassmorphism
* Smooth shadows
* Modern spacing
* Rounded corners (16px–20px)
* Hover animations
* Clean typography

Color Palette:

```css
Background: #0f172a
Card: rgba(255,255,255,0.05)
Primary: #14b8a6
Secondary: #3b82f6
Success: #22c55e
Warning: #f59e0b
Danger: #ef4444
Text: #f8fafc
Muted: #94a3b8
```

---

## Layout Structure

Replace the current long page with:

```text
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Top Navbar                                  │
├───────────────┬─────────────────────────────┤
│ Sidebar       │ Main Content Area           │
│               │                             │
│ Dashboard     │ Dynamic Forms               │
│ Auth          │ Response Viewer             │
│ Properties    │                             │
│ Users         │                             │
│ Favorites     │                             │
│ Chat          │                             │
│ Admin         │                             │
└───────────────┴─────────────────────────────┘
```

---

## Sidebar Navigation

Create collapsible sidebar menu:

### Dashboard

* Overview

### Authentication

* Register
* Verify Email
* Login

### Properties

* Create Property
* Get Properties
* Get Property By ID
* Update Property
* Delete Property
* Like Property

### User Management

* Profile
* Update Profile

### Favorites

* Toggle Favorite
* My Favorites

### Chat

* Search Users
* Chat History

### Admin

* Dashboard
* Customer List

Clicking a menu item should show its section and hide others.

---

## Dashboard Overview

At the top create statistic cards:

```text
Total Users
Total Properties
Favorites
API Requests
```

Use animated cards with Bootstrap Icons.

---

## Cards

Convert every endpoint into modern cards.

Example:

```text
┌──────────────────────────────┐
│ POST /api/auth/login         │
│ Login User                   │
│                              │
│ Email                        │
│ Password                     │
│                              │
│ [ Execute Request ]          │
└──────────────────────────────┘
```

---

## Endpoint Badges

Show method badges:

GET = Green

POST = Blue

PUT = Orange

DELETE = Red

Example:

```html
<span class="badge bg-success">GET</span>
```

---

## Response Viewer

Replace current `<pre>` with a professional API response panel.

Features:

* Syntax highlighted JSON
* Status indicator
* Copy response button
* Clear button
* Scrollable
* Dark terminal appearance

Example:

```text
Status: 200 ✓

{
  "success": true
}
```

---

## Token Section

Move token configuration into a sticky top card:

Fields:

* Base URL
* JWT Token
* Current User ID
* Common Property ID

Buttons:

* Save Token
* Clear Token

---

## Chat System Redesign

Transform chat section into WhatsApp-style UI.

Layout:

```text
┌──────────────┬──────────────────┐
│ Contacts     │ Conversation     │
│              │                  │
│ User List    │ Messages         │
│              │                  │
├──────────────┴──────────────────┤
│ Message Input           Send    │
└─────────────────────────────────┘
```

Requirements:

* Contact list on left
* Active chat on right
* Modern chat bubbles
* Sticky message input
* Smooth scrolling

---

## Forms

Improve all forms:

* Use Bootstrap floating labels
* Two-column grid layout
* Consistent spacing
* Better validation UI
* File upload preview support

---

## Admin Dashboard

Create modern analytics cards.

Display:

* Total Users
* Total Properties
* Total Favorites
* Active Chats

Use chart placeholders for future integration.

---

## Animations

Add:

* Card hover effects
* Fade-in transitions
* Smooth section switching
* Sidebar expand/collapse animation

---

## Mobile Responsive

Requirements:

* Sidebar becomes offcanvas menu
* Cards stack vertically
* Chat becomes full width
* Forms become single column

---

## Important

DO NOT remove or rename:

* Existing IDs
* Existing JavaScript functions
* Existing API endpoints
* Existing fetch logic
* Existing event listeners

Only redesign the UI and HTML structure while preserving all functionality.

Refactor the page into clean, maintainable Bootstrap 5 code with separate sections, reusable card layouts, and professional SaaS dashboard styling.

Return the COMPLETE updated `api-tester.ejs` file.
